{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031420/extras/0fea6067cfefcb3807408548b19a9f39.avif?t=1759749395\" width=616 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up strapped to a chair in a looping room. You can only rotate, blink, and choose. A narrator speaks to you \u2014 sometimes guiding, sometimes scaring. Each cycle, the room repeats one floor higher, with subtle or major changes. Your task is to tell reality from hallucination and see how far you can go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031420/extras/62c19391f53b97b4c6d5c2ba2babcfe6.poster.avif?t=1759749395\" width=616 height=177 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031420/extras/62c19391f53b97b4c6d5c2ba2babcfe6.webm?t=1759749395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031420/extras/4460e71602bb9246dcb4ae6fe9d1c706.webp?t=1759749395\" width=610 height=34 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd34 See something strange? Press red.  <br>\ud83d\udfe2 Everything looks normal? Press green.  <br>Each correct choice brings you closer to the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031420/extras/f50f0758aa26d8bd376ce37f4256e29e.poster.avif?t=1759749395\" width=616 height=177 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031420/extras/f50f0758aa26d8bd376ce37f4256e29e.webm?t=1759749395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031420/extras/9ac2ace7ec95bf6f6039187472a68adf.webp?t=1759749395\" width=616 height=34 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blink is the core mechanic.   <br> It is used to check anomalies: some may be imaginary, others real and dangerous. You won\u2019t know until you blink.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031420/extras/094d05fb0555e30caed4f75304746f44.poster.avif?t=1759749395\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031420/extras/094d05fb0555e30caed4f75304746f44.webm?t=1759749395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031420/extras/f4338dc8b698125c9d5b80b8fd5c9cc0.avif?t=1759749395\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf99\ufe0f\u00a0 1 narrator   <br>\ud83d\udd04 1 available ending  <br>\ud83d\udd0e 45+ anomalies  <br>\ud83d\udc08 Morty the Cat (preview appearance)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc7b 3 hidden  easter eggs </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031420/extras/26837b083012554a633ea2653f73eb24.avif?t=1759749395\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf99\ufe0f Multiple narrators - each with their own stories <br>\ud83d\udd04 5 endings - four standard and a final true ending  <br>\ud83d\udd0e 100+ anomalies <br>\ud83d\udc7b Hidden \u201cphantom anomalies\u201d and easter eggs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"No kitty should go hungry","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4031420/95c99d2488a03ce69105a8c6990986fc27e6b229.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4031420?t=1759749395","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031420/395504ffd5b2e30641d7c7f109e1286ca89a9364/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759749395","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031420/82e96804d036bc183ab3994d90f6d033592a336f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759749395","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031420/82e96804d036bc183ab3994d90f6d033592a336f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759749395","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains psychological horror elements, disturbing imagery, and scenes of violence. Some content may be unsettling, including depictions of blood and death."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031420/extras/0fea6067cfefcb3807408548b19a9f39.avif?t=1759749395\" width=616 height=92 /></sp